### Description

// php code to test the leak: (the file descriptor for this test 4.heic file was left open after im->desctroy(), which lead to too many files opened in my php fpm mode)

$im = new \Imagick();
$im->setOption('heic:preserve-orientation', true);
$im->readImage('/home/wwwuser/4.heic');
$im->destroy();

// issue location
coders/heic.c, function call heif_image_handle_get_context(image_handle)

// fixing
make a proper call to release the pointer. I was doing it at the end of below block.

#if LIBHEIF_NUMERIC_VERSION >= HEIC_COMPUTE_NUMERIC_VERSION(1,17,0)
    ...........
    heif_context=heif_image_handle_get_context(image_handle);
    ........... 
    ...........
    heif_context_free(heif_context);  // release the internal handle
#endif

// test shows the leak was gone

